# RX-005: Iodometric stoichiometry uses two thiosulfates per iodine
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 KI 0.001mol
add v1 I2 0.0001mol
measure v1 uvvis
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.0001mol
wait 1s
inspect v1
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.0001mol
wait 1s
inspect v1
measure v1 uvvis
inspect
